{"sha": "9ff649c8756a836523a178f3d79af9cd7d50ce1fbcc9dcc2c1ec491b60ee3e96", "body": ["\\textbf{11.} 令 $t = \\sin^2\\theta$（$\\theta \\in", "\\intoo0{\\pi/2}$, $\\dd t = 2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta$),", "$t^{x-1} = \\sin^{2x-2}\\theta$，且 $(1-t)^{y-1} =", "\\cos^{2y-2}\\theta$:", "\\[", "B(x,y) = \\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^{2x-2}\\theta\\,\\cos^{2y-2}\\theta", "\\cdot 2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta", "= 2\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^{2x-1}\\theta\\,\\cos^{2y-1}\\theta\\,", "\\dd\\theta .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{12.} 取 $y = \\frac12$（使余弦因子消失），", "并令 $2x - 1 = n$：$B\\bigl(\\frac{n+1}2, \\frac12\\bigr) = 2W_n$，即\\", "$W_n = \\frac12 B\\bigl(\\frac{n+1}2,\\frac12\\bigr)$。关于第一变量的", "降阶关系给出", "\\[", "\\frac{W_n}{W_{n-2}}", "= \\frac{B\\bigl(\\frac{n-1}2 + 1, \\frac12\\bigr)}", "{B\\bigl(\\frac{n-1}2, \\frac12\\bigr)}", "= \\frac{\\frac{n-1}2}{\\frac{n-1}2 + \\frac12}", "= \\frac{n-1}{n} :", "\\]", "即沃利斯递推式，这一次不再对正弦作分部积分 ---", "第二部分已一劳永逸地完成了这项工作。", "", "\\textbf{13.} $B\\bigl(\\frac12,\\frac12\\bigr) = 2W_0 =", "2\\cdot\\frac\\pi2 = \\pi$，而", "$\\Gamma\\bigl(\\frac12\\bigr)^2/\\Gamma(1) = (\\sqrt\\pi)^2 = \\pi$:", "欧拉公式在 $\\bigl(\\frac12,\\frac12\\bigr)$ 处成立。", "", "\\textbf{14.} 迭代 $W_{2n} = \\frac{2n-1}{2n}W_{2n-2}$，", "并以 $W_0 = \\frac\\pi2$ 为起点：", "\\[", "W_{2n} = \\frac\\pi2\\prod_{k=1}^{n}\\frac{2k-1}{2k}", "= \\frac\\pi2\\cdot\\frac{(2n)!}{4^n(n!)^2},", "\\]", "因为 $\\prod(2k-1) = \\frac{(2n)!}{2^n n!}$，且 $\\prod 2k = 2^n", "n!$。于是利用第 3 题：", "\\[", "B\\Bigl(n+\\frac12, \\frac12\\Bigr) = 2W_{2n}", "= \\pi\\,\\frac{(2n)!}{4^n(n!)^2}", "= \\frac{(2n)!\\sqrt\\pi}{4^n n!}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}{n!}", "= \\frac{\\Gamma\\bigl(n+\\frac12\\bigr)\\Gamma\\bigl(\\frac12\\bigr)}", "{\\Gamma(n+1)} .", "\\]", "现固定 $x \\in \\frac12\\N^*$。欧拉公式在 $(x,", "\\frac12)$ 处成立：$x$ 为整数时由第 10 题（利用对称性）得到，", "$x = n + \\frac12$ 时即上式。欧拉公式的两端", "均满足降阶递推 $y \\mapsto y + 1$", "（左端由第 8 题，右端由函数方程，", "同第 10 题）：由归纳法，公式自 $y =", "\\frac12$ 与 $y = 1$ 出发，推及每个 $y \\in \\frac12\\N^*$。欧拉", "公式因此在 $2x, 2y \\in \\N^*$ 时成立。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 令 $u = \\frac{t}{1-t}$，即\\ $t =", "\\frac{u}{1+u}$, $1 - t = \\frac{1}{1+u}$, $\\dd t =", "\\frac{\\dd u}{(1+u)^2}$:", "\\[", "B(x,y) = \\int_0^\\infty", "\\Bigl(\\frac{u}{1+u}\\Bigr)^{x-1}", "\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{1+u}\\Bigr)^{y-1}", "\\frac{\\dd u}{(1+u)^2}", "= \\int_0^\\infty \\frac{u^{x-1}}{(1+u)^{x+y}}\\,\\dd u .", "\\]", "当 $x = y = \\frac12$ 时，取 $u = v^2$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^\\infty \\frac{u^{-1/2}}{1+u}\\dd u", "= \\int_0^\\infty \\frac{2\\,\\dd v}{1+v^2} = \\pi", "= B\\Bigl(\\frac12,\\frac12\\Bigr) . \\checkmark", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{16.} 作一次分部积分，对 $1 \\leq k \\leq n$", "及 $s > 0$（取 $u = (1 - t/n)^k$，$v = t^s/s$；边界项", "为零）：", "\\[", "\\int_0^n \\Bigl(1-\\frac tn\\Bigr)^{\\!k} t^{s-1}\\dd t", "= \\frac{k}{ns}\\int_0^n \\Bigl(1-\\frac tn\\Bigr)^{\\!k-1}", "t^{s}\\dd t .", "\\]", "从 $k = n$，$s = x$ 出发，迭代 $n$ 次：", "\\[", "\\int_0^n \\Bigl(1-\\frac tn\\Bigr)^{\\!n} t^{x-1}\\dd t", "= \\frac{n(n-1)\\cdots1}{n^n\\,x(x+1)\\cdots(x+n-1)}", "\\int_0^n t^{x+n-1}\\dd t", "= \\frac{n!}{n^n}\\cdot", "\\frac{n^{x+n}}{x(x+1)\\cdots(x+n)} ,", "\\]", "即 $\\dfrac{n!\\,n^x}{x(x+1)\\cdots(x+n)}$。", "", "\\textbf{17.} 由\\cref{exo:b2:integration:7}知左端趋于", "$\\Gamma(x)$（控制收敛定理，控制函数为", "$t^{x-1}\\eu^{-t}$）；右端为高斯商：", "\\[", "\\Gamma(x) = \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}", "\\frac{n!\\,n^x}{x(x+1)\\cdots(x+n)} .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{18.} 对第 16 题中的商", "$G_n(x)$ 取对数，并将 $\\ln(x+k) = \\ln k + \\ln(1 + x/k)$ 拆开，对 $k", "\\geq 1$:", "\\[", "\\ln G_n(x) = x\\ln n - \\ln x - \\sum_{k=1}^n", "\\ln\\Bigl(1+\\frac xk\\Bigr)", "= -\\ln x + x(\\ln n - H_n)", "+ \\sum_{k=1}^n\\Bigl(\\frac xk -", "\\ln\\Bigl(1+\\frac xk\\Bigr)\\Bigr).", "\\]", "当 $u \\geq 0$ 时，$u - \\frac{u^2}2 \\leq \\ln(1+u) \\leq u$，故", "一般项落在 $\\intcc{0}{x^2/(2k^2)}$ 中，级数", "收敛（与 $\\sum k^{-2}$ 比较）。由于 $\\ln n - H_n", "\\to -\\gamma$（见\\cref{ex:b2:comparison:harmonic}），且 $\\ln G_n(x)", "\\to \\ln\\Gamma(x)$（由第 17 题及 $\\ln$ 的连续性）：", "\\[", "\\ln\\Gamma(x) = -\\ln x - \\gamma x", "+ \\sum_{k=1}^\\infty\\Bigl(\\frac xk -", "\\ln\\Bigl(1+\\frac xk\\Bigr)\\Bigr) .", "\\]", ""]}